; RT24 / PT24 (#709), ADR 0047 and PT23/PT24 as updated by PR #836.
; Expectations come from independent arithmetic or stored AutoCAD blocks.
; No Tecnigrafo executable was used to derive these values.

; Valid dimensions are edited into invalid definitions; invalid definitions cannot
; be introduced directly in a .tgq file. Rejections must leave the original intact.
A = DIMENSION kind=angular style="ISO-25" line-point=0,1 first=0,0;10,0 second=0,1;0,10 arc-point=6,8 text-point=100,100 measurement=0 text=" " user-text-position=yes
? grip A 0,10 10,1 -> invalid
? grip A 10,0 0,10 -> invalid
? grip A 6,8 0,0 -> invalid
? grip A 123,456 0,0 -> none
? grips A -> 0,0; 10,0; 0,1; 0,10; 6,8; 100,100
; Parallel and coincident lines: corpus geom2d/intersezione-limite-stessa-retta-intera.
; A near-parallel but ordinary slope 1/1000 remains valid.
Near = DIMENSION kind=angular style="ISO-25" line-point=-100,-0.1 first=-100,0;100,0 second=-100,-0.1;100,0.1 arc-point=10,0.005 text-point=100,100 measurement=0 text=" " user-text-position=yes overrides=DIMASZ:0,DIMCEN:0
? generated Near -> ARC center=0,0 radius=10.00000124999992 start-angle=0 end-angle=0.05729576041450061
